<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-T2-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-T2-001" ;
  triage:title "Missing tests: writer shutdown drain, batch drain, queue-full behavior" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-rusqlite/src/writer/mod.rs — No test for writer shutdown + pending-work drain (QA-001), no test for queue-full behavior at capacity 256 (QA-002). T.3 QA-1 confirms these are still unresolved carry-forwards from T.2. T.2 fix landed at 8fde385 (fn writer_drop_drains_queued_messages_before_exit, fn writer_commits_more_than_one_batch_boundary_of_messages, fn shutdown_first_drains_pending_submitters_with_daemon_unavailable, fn submit_times_out_when_the_queue_is_full). T.3 merged T.2 at 5275b3c (pre-fix) so all four test functions are absent from T.3. Merge-forward of 8fde385 into T.3 required." ;
  triage:category "ATM-QA" ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-T" ;
  triage:triageMode "followup_pass" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
